00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.000
For those of y'all who don't know,

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.370
I've gotten serious about
meditation over the last

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:19.170
couple of years and you know meditation

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.480
can evoke different images
in a lot of people's minds.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:23.550
A lot of people view
it as a spiritual thing

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:27.130
or a religious thing, but
here we're just talking

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.410
about it in the most general possible way

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:32.960
