00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.870
to help still our minds.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.980
For coping with some of what many of us

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.900
are going through right now.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:43.070
And you know the first
meditations we put out

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.340
this is actually only a few weeks ago.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:47.880
Were student meditations
